	@ - Act 2: allow Destroy Data; forbid Secure Route / Deploy Agent / Extract Staff.
	@ - Act 3: allow Extract Staff; forbid Secure Route / Deploy Agent / Destroy Data.
	@ - Act 4: forbid all commands.
